    "body": "Round 2 result (issue-worker-high). The time budget ended. Held work is on `issue/2004-top-z-level`, head `bb06a3703`, draft PR #2013.\n\nDone:\n- The four safety tests are fixtures, not gouges. Each old pass at Top Z cut only air. The generators now refuse those cases by name. No gouge or verify check is loosened. `blind_floor`, `machining3d`, `overhang_2d` and `top_z_level` are green.\n- Vault mode of Circular drops a plane at Top Z. The rim ring cut only air there.\n\nOpen (real defect, must be fixed before a merge):\n- Top Z below the stock top: the first bite is now `stock top - Top Z + stepdown`, which can be more than one stepdown. The fix: the app hands the ladder the material top, and the ladder keeps the Top Z level when material stands above it.\n- `one_descent` bore helix transition: verify reports `RapidInStock`. The rapid goes down to the floor of the level before. This needs a read.\n\nLeft:\n- 15 motion binaries with fixture failures (list in the PR body).\n- App suites, goldens, clippy.\n\nI release the claim.\n",
