    "body": "Round 3 result (issue-worker-high). Head `538776d93` on `issue/2004-top-z-level`, PR #2013 (draft). The work is not complete. I release the claim.\n\nFixed in round 3:\n1. `one_descent`, bore helix transition: a real rapid into stock. The rapid went down to Z -2 at r 6.55, and the tool disc went 0.45 mm into the core that no ring had cut (Z -2 to 0). Now a transition whose column is not open starts at the top of the cut plus the plunge height (Z 2). Verify is not changed.\n2. Top Z below the stock top: `Approach::material_top` (runtime only). The app sets it from the setup stock top. `cut_levels_under` keeps the level at Top Z when stock stands over Top Z. The pocket region planes read the same top.\n3. Fixtures that counted the Top Z air level: `center_cut_law`, `predrilled_entry`, `level_links`, `rotary_offset::the_seam_closes_into_a_full_ring`.\n\nGreen: `one_descent` 3/3, `top_z_level` 11/11, `center_cut_law` 6/6, `predrilled_entry` 6/6, `level_links` 12/12, `blind_floor`, `machining3d`, `overhang_2d`. Clippy on `camcraft-motion` is clean. `cargo check -p camcraft-app --tests` is clean.\n\nRemaining:\n- Red: `rotary_offset::the_height_window_names_the_stations_and_refuses_an_empty_one` (the window now refuses; the old program appears to cut only air - needs a decision).\n- Red, not read: `face_blend` 1, `face_holes` 1, `entry_arc` 2, `adaptive_hsm` 1, `rotary_adaptive` 2, `machining2d` 14, `circular_arcs` 2, `corner_blend_arc_contour` 1, `corner_blend` 3, `arcs` 2.\n- Trace and trochoidal slot do not read the material top yet (no `links` field there).\n- Not run: app suites, goldens.\n",
